% M22-review-bugs (D-0231): a CONSTANT first letter below the automaton's symbols (1..2),
% so layer 1 dies forward with nothing to cite. The constraint is false.
predicate baguette_regular(array [int] of var int: x,int: Q,int: smin,array [int] of int: d,int: q0,array [int] of int: F,array [int] of var bool: s);
var 1..2: x :: output_var;
var bool: s1;
var bool: s2;
var bool: s3;
var bool: s4;
var bool: s5;
var bool: s6;
constraint baguette_regular([-2, x], 2, 1, [1, 2, 2, 0], 1, [1, 2], [s1, s2, s3, s4, s5, s6]);
solve satisfy;
